<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">4 November in history</h1><p class="ref-lede">6 events that happened on 4 November, from 1333 to 2008.</p></header>
<ol class="day-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb tih-event-hero"><p class="tih-hero-kicker">&#10022; Anniversary of the day</p><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/arno" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/arno.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1333 CE <span class="tih-ago">693 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">The Arno floods Florence</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">After days of heavy rain, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/arno">Arno</a> burst its banks and swept away three of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/florence">Florence</a>'s four bridges, including the Ponte Vecchio. The chronicler Giovanni Villani recorded the disaster in detail.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/florence">Florence</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1918 CE <span class="tih-ago">108 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">The poet Wilfred Owen is killed in action</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Wilfred Owen was killed crossing the Sambre-<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oise">Oise</a> Canal in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a>, a week before the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/armistice-of-11-november-1918">armistice</a>. His poems, including 'Dulce et Decorum Est', became the defining English verse of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/first-world-war">First World War</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/first-world-war">First World War</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1922 CE <span class="tih-ago">104 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Howard Carter finds the steps to Tutankhamun's tomb</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Howard Carter's workers uncovered a step cut into the rock of the Valley of the Kings, leading to the nearly intact tomb of Tutankhamun. Its treasures caused a worldwide sensation.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1956 CE <span class="tih-ago">70 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Soviet tanks move in to crush the Hungarian Revolution</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Soviet forces launched a massive assault on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/budapest">Budapest</a> at dawn, overthrowing <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/imre-nagy">Imre Nagy</a>'s government. Thousands were killed, and the West did not intervene.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/budapest">Budapest</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1979 CE <span class="tih-ago">47 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Students seize the US embassy in Tehran</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Iranian students occupied the US embassy in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tehran">Tehran</a> and took 66 hostages. Fifty-two were held for 444 days, a crisis that soured US-Iranian relations and damaged <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jimmy-carter">Jimmy Carter</a>'s presidency.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">2008 CE <span class="tih-ago">18 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Barack Obama is elected president</h2><p class="tih-event-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/barack-obama">Barack Obama</a> defeated John McCain to become the first African American elected president of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a>, 45 years after <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/martin-luther">Martin Luther</a> King's 'I Have a Dream' speech.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a></div></div></li></ol>
